    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Martial_Arts_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Martial Arts Feats\">Martial Arts Feats</a></i></p><p>You are trained in the Teräs Käsi <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a> fighting style and can send an enemy reeling with a single punch.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> 13, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Martial_Arts_I\" title=\"Martial Arts I\">Martial Arts I</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per round when you make a successful <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed Attack\">Unarmed Attack</a>, you reduce the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Threshold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Threshold\">Damage Threshold</a> by 5 when determining the effect of the attack.</p><p><b>Special:</b> If you have the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ter%C3%A4s_K%C3%A4si_Basics\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Teräs Käsi Basics\">Teräs Käsi Basics</a></b> Talent, you are considered to be one size category larger when determining the damage of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks\" title=\"Unarmed Attacks\">Unarmed Attacks</a>.</p>",
